# Panda Reader

## Workspace

- `apps/panda-reader` — GPUI desktop app
- `crates/panda-core` — shared types
- `crates/panda-store` — local articles and feeds
- `crates/panda-miniflux` — Miniflux client

## Build

- On Windows, when building from a mapped or network drive, set `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` to a local disk to avoid MSVC PDB errors. Keep machine-specific absolute paths out of the shared Cargo config.
- Run with `cargo run -p panda-reader` (or the local `CARGO_TARGET_DIR` override documented in `AGENTS.md`).

## Product / UI

- Local data lives under the app data dir for `com.PandaReader.PandaReader` (`panda-reader.sqlite3`, `preferences.json`, `miniflux.json`).
- Left column uses Inter. Do not vendor Anthropic Sans (proprietary, no Chinese glyphs).
